Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.170
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.170
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:19.350
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:19.350
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.680
This love...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.680
Omoi wo

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.160
I finally... found you...

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.170
You're my...

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.210
Pair!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.920
Anxiety Of The Swallowtail Butterfly

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.390
You're... Rynax...

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.890
Why are you here?

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:10.020
Finally... I finally found you...

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.460
You will be my Pair!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.800
Why? Why are you running away?

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.000
Why do you run away from me?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.630
I...

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.970
I'm not your Pair!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.910
Security guard!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.250
Big trouble! Big trouble!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.580
Hurry, come!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.790
What's the matter?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.710
This way, this way!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.670
Look!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.060
Well, this certainly is a serious problem...

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:12.850
Here you go.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.350
Thank you!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.900
A GPO man!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.070
Are you okay, little girl?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.360
Y-Yes...

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.610
Will this bus take me to the town festival?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.870
Yeah, it's at the 5th bus stop.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:57.830
Come in.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.540
Excuse me, sir.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.170
What is it?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.680
I brought you some food.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.970
You become less efficient when your
blood sugar level drops.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.240
We've captured all the Ryna sapiens on the list...

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.200
Lately, all we do is paperwork.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.250
Are you unhappy with that?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.000
That's not what I meant.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.710
I was just wondering what will become of us.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.510
We'll just be assigned to another mission.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.220
Unless, of course, a different situation arises...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.180
Did you have something in mind?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.350
No...

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.610
What is it?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.070
Assistant Brightman would
like to see you immediately.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.200
Assistant Brightman?

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.030
I'll be right there.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.600
Inspector Wong at your service.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.230
So you're Wong?

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.770
I'll get right to the point.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.610
I want your unit to capture this Ryna sapien.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:54.620
His name is Yvon Tardieu.
He escaped from the Moon.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.200
To observe this Ryna sapien,

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.620
a chip to monitor his powers
has been implanted in his brain.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.210
We have detected a signal in Switzerland.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.210
Switzerland?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:10.630
One of our men had been following him, but we've lost contact.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.090
More than likely, he's been erased.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.180
Our target has lost its Pair
and is considered dangerous.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.640
What's his rank?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.890
Special A class.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.770
Equal to Kurau, the one you were after.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.730
Why?

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:34.860
Why am I only now finding out about
a Ryna sapien of that caliber?

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:41.750
The reason why we didn't inform you is because
this Ryna sapien was under our supervision.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:46.420
Then all the more so! I should've been given
some feedback on the information you had!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.340
Especially when we were chasing Kurau!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.420
There was no need to tell you.
That was the decision.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:59.390
I cant agree to execute this mission without
being given a sufficient amount of information!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.600
What I'm about to tell you is strictly confidential.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:11.440
This Ryna sapien is not a product
of the accident two years ago.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:16.570
It's a Ryna sapien created through experimentation.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.740
Why?

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:22.950
Theoretically, we should take care of this problem,

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.750
but since your unit has experience chasing Kurau, you'd be better qualified.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.750
Execute this mission promptly.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.920
I look forward to the results.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.600
Ayaka, summon the unit.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.520
Huh?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.400
We're moving out!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.270
Y-Yes, sir!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.470
What's wrong?

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.890
A child... Out of nowhere...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.600
What?!

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.520
Open the door!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.480
Come on, open the door!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:32.040
Sorry... I'm tired...

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.710
Stop whining, will ya?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.500
Equal to Kurau's powers?!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:13.580
A Rynax that lost its Pair
will instinctively look for another.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.460
That's what has been reported.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.710
Pair?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.510
So that means our target is seeking out another Ryna sapien?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.260
We cannot rule out that possibility.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.180
Powers equal to Kurau...

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.230
Kurau...

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.270
That can't be...

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.700
Don't be scared. I won't do anything to you.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.370
Wait...

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.840
Why do you run away?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.880
You can do it...

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.590
You can still fly, can't you?

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.220
Christmas!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.390
Kurau!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.600
What's wrong?

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.150
Kurau! I'm scared!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.480
What happened, Christmas?

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.570
I see...

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.570
So you already have a Pair!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.750
You're... Rynax...

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.500
He made a policeman disappear.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.540
I'm going to become a Pair with that girl.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.420
Not out here!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.360
Kurau!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.980
Hide here!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.860
Kurau!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.700
Who are you?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.660
What are you after?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.660
Look at this.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.580
See? It feels weird all the time.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.840
I always feel tired now.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:50.510
My head hurts too and
I have a hard time breathing.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.800
It's probably because I don't have my Pair.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.890
You're weakening!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.760
You should go back to the world you came from!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.480
Go back to the world I came from?

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.610
But I like this world.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.360
This vast world!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.610
Stop it!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.870
If you keep pushing yourself,
then you'll break that kid's body.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.540
You'll get weak and die too.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.830
Who cares what happens to this body?

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:27.130
If I can be saved from this pain...

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.500
Who cares what happens?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.340
I know! Then... do you want to be my Pair?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.510
There's no way... I can do that.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.220
What happened to your Pair?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:43.390
Be quiet! Fight me for that girl!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.440
Stop!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:26.350
Kurau!

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:27.600
Kurau!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.610
Enough already...

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.910
You...

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.370
You lost your Pair because
you were called by humans.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.080
This is unforgivable...

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.500
Your memories are full of
happy times with your Pair!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.190
Kurau! Kurau!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.690
Kurau... Hold it together!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.320
Kurau! Kurau!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.210
Stop it!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:12.630
Why? Why are you being so mean to Kurau?!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.710
I hate you!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.170
You... will be my Pair.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.470
I don't want to be!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.320
Get out of my way...

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:40.740
My whole body is tired... and I'm at my limit.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:43.780
Move!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.330
I Said, MOVE!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.200
No!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.410
Then... What am I supposed to do?!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.290
I don't know!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.830
But if Kurau...

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:58.760
If Kurau's gone, then I can't go on living either!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.260
I won't be able to live...

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:18.440
I see... You won't be able to live...

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:23.320
That's... what happens to those who lose their Pair.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:30.580
I knew that... That I no longer had a sky to fly in...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:36.130
I knew that... all along...

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.590
That my Pair was gone...

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.740
This feels great.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:46.860
From a great distance

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:46.860
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
You smile at me

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.340
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.340
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.430
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.430
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:00.230
Moonlight

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:00.230
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.870
Next Episode

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:13.870
Grandpa, the festival isn't that way.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:17.000
She's not going to the festival.

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:19.540
That girl had a scar on her face.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:21.920
Don't say such things.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
The Gravestones On Top Of The Hill
